            <aside id="detailPanel" class="dash-card min-h-[600px] p-5"><div class="flex h-full min-h-[520px] items-center justify-center text-center text-gray-500"><div><i class="fas fa-comments mb-3 text-4xl"></i><p>Pilih percakapan untuk melihat detail.</p></div></div></aside>
